MNF15-P1-D D3 gate log (2026-11-14) — cost-weighted probe census (bounded measurement)

D3 scope (per instruction): a MEASUREMENT exercise against the D2
baseline. Budget frozen (body 8 MiB + tile-8 MiB), no admission policy
changes, no production optimization. The D0 census counted redundant
probes; D3 measures their EXPENSE.

Instrument (test-gated, zero release overhead):
  ProbeOrigin { Lit, M3, LawLattice, LawBilinear, FlatField, AtlasExact,
  AtlasColor } threads through ProbeCache::probe; every real cache miss
  records (configuration, origin, wall time, exhausted?, stored bytes)
  into a per-family table (mnf6::mnf6_p1d_census::D3). The product code
  path is unchanged (the origin tag is a compile-time-transparent
  parameter; cost logic untouched).

Census tables (p1d_probe_census, representative run):
  screenshot_640x400 — 676,570 executed misses, 5.9 s miss wall:
    zlib/atlas-exact : 254,848 execs, 6,609 distinct, 2,568.3 ms (43.7%,
      mean 10.08 us) — 100% budget-exhausted, 0 stored
    zlib/atlas-color : 254,848 execs, 6,609 distinct, 2,566.1 ms (43.7%,
      mean 10.07 us) — 100% budget-exhausted, 0 stored
    zlib/law-lattice : 20,808, 13,385 distinct, 275.8 ms (4.7%) — exhausted
    zstd3/atlas-*    : 55,971+55,985, 6,600/6,608 distinct, 139.6+136.9 ms
